Package: becomingfluentindata
Title: Becoming Fluent in Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Marco", "Kuehne", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Source of the bookdown project "Becoming Fluent in Data".
    This file is not a real R package. It exists so that every package the
    book needs can be installed with a single command on a fresh machine:
    remotes::install_deps() or pak::local_install_deps().
    Imports: everything an evaluated chunk needs, so that a clean checkout
    builds. Suggests: packages that appear only in prose, in commented-out
    code, or in chunks marked eval = FALSE - the book builds without them.
    The book-wide packages are attached once in the setup chunk of index.Rmd
    (new_session: no, so they stay attached); everything else is attached in
    the single chapter that uses it.
License: file LICENSE
